# Renderer Rules

- Renderer depends only on RHI abstraction.
- Avoid exposing backend-specific rendering details.
- Separate rendering logic from resource management.
- Keep frame graph logic isolated.
- Avoid mixing scene logic with rendering logic.
- Prefer explicit render passes.
- Avoid unnecessary renderer state mutation.
- Use clear ownership for render resources.
- Prefer data-oriented rendering structures when beneficial.
- Minimize renderer-global mutable state.
- Avoid hidden rendering side effects.